%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-binaries-functions-fromhex (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  {
     hexToBinary: "TXVsZQ==" as Binary {base: "64"}
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Binaries
output application/dw
---
{ "hexToBinary": fromHex("4D756C65") }
%%% output application/dw
{
  hexToBinary: "TXVsZQ==" as Binary {base: "64"} as Binary {base: "16"}
}
